BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eight Step Recovery Group for Men
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260618T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260618T183000
UID:8443d7567cf84ddd519b2bfd@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Eight Step Recovery is an alternative recovery program to the 
 12-Step program of Alcoholic Anonymous. The program is a set of mindfulnes
 s teachings outlining a suggested course of action for recovery from addic
 tion\, stinking thinking\, negative mental states\, and compulsive and obs
 essive behaviours.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/eight-step-recovery-for-
 men-18-jun
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Class: Meditation & In-Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260618T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260618T211500
UID:dbcac64e46d0f83bad28b500@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The Noble Eightfold Path is one of the Buddha's most complete 
 and practical guides to living a life that leads to liberation. Over eight
  weeks\, we will explore each step of the path\, drawing on Bhante Urgyen 
 Sangharakshita's seminal lecture series as our guide.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/thurs-night-18-jun
END:VEVENT
